{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026b4bcLZUt941793082059.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人黃敏碩於節目中推介金蝶國際(268)，指內地軟件、即服務企業資源規劃系統，以及資訊科技服務兩行業的收入增速加快，料延續至下半年，帶動中資軟件股增長。公司中期業績扭虧為盈，加上雲端及AI套件需求高增長，盈利能見度高。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026654cuRdA7n1793082071.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>黃敏碩認為現價、即9.25元可買入，目標價上望10元，若失守8.34元便止蝕。</p><p></p><p>金蝶國際(268)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$9.25</p><p>目標：$10</p><p>止蝕：$8.34</p><p></p><p>股評人伍禮賢推介太興集團(6811)，認為本地企業股不太跟大市氣氛，公司基本面亦展現韌性，上半年盈利增長83.5%，毛利率不跌反升至73.5%，有賴於建立各類細分餐飲市場的多品牌策略。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026prMgVkVFQj1793082087.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>伍禮賢認為，現價、即1.55元便可買入，目標價看1.75元，止蝕價在1.4元，並提醒股份成交額偏少，不宜大額部署。</p><p></p><p>太興集團(6811)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$1.55</p><p>目標：$1.75</p><p>止蝕：$1.4</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:20.047645+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":395,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:20.122063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:24.682047+00:00","content_hash":"ac1abdddf9163362543b4685f2bbda08ea78653fb1972a2c6547009314e7e4e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:20.047645+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}